WEBVTT

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:03.020
<i>Previously on </i>Anime-Gataris<i>!</i>

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:06.860
<i>The student council has made a complaint 
about the anime club's school festival event.</i>

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:10.820
<i>We all tried together to come 
up with something to present.</i>

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:12.320
An anime short script is a piece of cake.

00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:15.740
<i>And we decided to make an anime 
short that Miko-chan proposed.</i>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:17.280
You jerk!

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:18.940
<i>We all worked hard together.</i>

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:21.080
<i>We were almost done, when...</i>

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:25.420
If you can't fill this up, 
we'll deem your presentation a failure.

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:29.460
<i>We might </i>really<i> end up 
getting shut down this time.</i>

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:32.930
My name is Yuirin!

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:36.670
I'm a magician that loves 
excitement and explosions!

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:40.570
My name is...

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:42.310
My name...

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:45.630
Am I doing this right?

00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:48.500
I'm not used to talking cutely.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:51.650
Oh, what if I add some shouting?

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:53.150
My name is...

00:00:53.940 --> 00:00:54.870
Yuirin!

00:00:55.940 --> 00:00:56.880
That seems good.

00:00:56.880 --> 00:01:00.030
Hi, can I say my line like that?

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:34.090
Wait, Tsubaki.

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:39.600
I'll be looking forward to it, 
Anime Club President.

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:41.100
P-President!

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:43.540
Pardon us.

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:48.180
Erika-senpai, any luck with the 
student council president?

00:02:50.070 --> 00:02:53.270
How are we supposed to fill that huge venue?

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:56.730
There are a ton of unfinished 
scenes in the anime.

00:02:57.190 --> 00:03:01.140
The ending dance scene is 
nowhere near done, too.

00:03:01.730 --> 00:03:03.160
I know.

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:04.280
What should we do?

00:03:05.470 --> 00:03:07.490
Don't worry, Minoa-chan.

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:09.180
Nakano-senpai.

00:03:09.180 --> 00:03:12.380
Even if it doesn't get finished, 
we should present it.

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:17.000
It'll be a testament to our 
anime club's existence.

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:22.260
A testament to our existence, huh?

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:24.730
No, I don't want it to be unfinished.

00:03:24.730 --> 00:03:25.830
I...

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:26.910
Minoa...

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:32.480
There's just no way to finish 
it on time, given our schedule.

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:35.270
There's nothing more we can do.

00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:42.970
<i>Everyone's really tired.</i>

00:03:42.970 --> 00:03:44.640
<i>I can't blame them.</i>

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:47.450
<i>If I, as the director, called it quits...</i>

00:03:50.070 --> 00:03:51.670
Sorry, everyone.

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:54.420
Give me a day to think.

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:04.680
Mii-chan.

00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:07.930
What's wrong? You haven't even had dinner.

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:09.680
Onee-chan...

00:04:10.230 --> 00:04:12.690
I had no idea.

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:17.020
Sorry, we can't use the 
dubbing room anymore, either.

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:17.990
Too bad.

00:04:17.990 --> 00:04:19.350
I was looking forward to it.

00:04:19.350 --> 00:04:21.940
I mean, I'm Cute Girl A.

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:23.810
It's a great scene.

00:04:23.810 --> 00:04:26.070
You show up looking really sharp,

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:30.930
and for the ending, we had the dance 
scene that Mom choreographed for us.

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:33.720
That looks awesome.

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:36.760
It's not done yet, though.

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:38.070
Use this.

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:41.450
It's a DAT recorder.

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:44.340
You can record short lines at home.

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:45.840
Dad.

00:04:46.190 --> 00:04:51.850
I was really happy to see you 
working hard towards something.

00:04:52.230 --> 00:04:53.350
Listen, Minoa!

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:55.890
Remember how it was on <i>AKIBAKO</i>?

00:04:55.890 --> 00:04:59.360
Anime production is always 
a race against time.

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:04.360
Every moment, up to the minute 
it airs, is put to use.

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:06.230
Why do they do that?

00:05:06.230 --> 00:05:07.200
Why else?

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:10.120
It's for the sake of the fans looking 
forward to the completed anime.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:13.870
For the people watching anime!

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:17.120
Don't you remember being excited about 
the upcoming anime when you were little?

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:18.880
Now it's your turn to make anime.

00:05:19.190 --> 00:05:22.480
Don't you ever give up, 
no matter how tough it gets.

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:23.910
You have two days, including tomorrow.

00:05:23.910 --> 00:05:26.510
Two days is enough to finish a whole book!

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:28.430
A new book? What?

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:30.640
Oh, that's, well...

00:05:31.070 --> 00:05:34.340
Why are you getting so intense over anime?

00:05:34.340 --> 00:05:36.270
Dad, are you...

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:39.020
That's right, Dad's an otaku.

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:43.910
S-Since when?!

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:46.230
I had no idea.

00:05:46.230 --> 00:05:50.280
Oh, didn't you meet him in summer by the sea?

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:52.280
By the sea?

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:56.160
Wait, he was at the event?

00:05:56.570 --> 00:05:58.040
He's there every year.

00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:00.670
It's his purpose in life.

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:02.800
It's over!

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:05.930
All this effort to put together the 
perfect, dignified father image!

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:07.470
It's all over!

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:09.450
You've never had dignity.

00:06:10.940 --> 00:06:12.430
That's not true.

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:18.310
You were really badass 
preaching about anime, Dad.

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:19.810
Minoa...

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:23.650
You finally understand!

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:25.830
I'm so lucky to have such great daughters.

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:28.710
Anyway, I'm going to borrow this.

00:06:28.970 --> 00:06:32.830
I don't know if it's worth recording. 
We might not be able to finish the anime.

00:06:33.260 --> 00:06:35.690
You're the director, aren't you?

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:37.450
Y-Yeah.

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:42.180
So just talk to everyone tomorrow 
about what you want to do.

00:06:42.180 --> 00:06:44.460
What I want to do?

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:45.940
That's right.

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:47.380
It's just like a sports club.

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:49.990
The coach's passion brings the team together

00:06:49.990 --> 00:06:52.470
and points everyone towards one goal, right?

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:54.350
Onee-chan...

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:01.980
Okay, here I go, Cute Girl A.

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:04.710
Man A is here, too.

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:06.190
You're too close!

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:08.440
You hit me.

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:10.740
Not even Mom's hit me.

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:13.050
Come on, now, don't lie.

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:21.370
Anime Club (6)

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:21.370
Guys...

00:07:26.370 --> 00:07:27.250
I'm turning.

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:33.760
Minoa, how's the anime coming along?

00:07:33.990 --> 00:07:36.260
I-It's almost done.

00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:39.770
Sorry I can't help out in class too much.

00:07:40.800 --> 00:07:42.270
Leave that to me.

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:43.400
Break a leg.

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:45.560
Okay.

00:07:54.230 --> 00:07:57.080
What's up? It's marked as <i>read</i>, 
but they're ignoring you?

00:07:58.070 --> 00:07:59.780
Why are you up there?

00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:03.290
I don't need to tell you!

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:09.250
Jeez, it's not that they're
reading it and ignoring me.

00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:11.430
So they're <i>legit</i> ignoring you.

00:08:11.430 --> 00:08:13.260
You didn't have to be <i>that</i> blunt about it.

00:08:20.120 --> 00:08:22.780
No one's read it since yesterday.

00:08:22.780 --> 00:08:24.520
Maybe it's no use.

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:29.530
They probably half-assed it because they 
didn't think they could finish it to begin with.

00:08:30.050 --> 00:08:31.440
That's not true!

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:36.150
We spent the last three 
months making the anime.

00:08:36.150 --> 00:08:38.200
We hit so many problems.

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:41.730
But we got this far because 
everyone helped out.

00:08:41.730 --> 00:08:44.210
I could never have done anything by myself.

00:08:44.450 --> 00:08:48.610
I'm the director. I know better than 
anyone how hard everyone's been working.

00:08:49.540 --> 00:08:51.840
So I can't give up now.

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:54.800
I, I...

00:08:59.550 --> 00:09:00.590
Good.

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:03.730
<b>Scene 34</b>

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:04.600
<b>Scene 29</b>

00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:04.600
<i>I'm not giving up.</i>

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:04.600
<b>Scene 25</b>

00:09:05.220 --> 00:09:07.600
<i>I'm going to do everything I can.</i>

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:09.730
<b>Scene 35</b>

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:14.280
Sorry I'm late.

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:20.120
I brought the unfinished 
scenes from the art club.

00:09:20.590 --> 00:09:23.120
I finished the novel adaptation.

00:09:23.610 --> 00:09:27.390
I thought we could use scenes from 
our production for the ending.

00:09:27.390 --> 00:09:28.880
I edited it together.

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:32.130
I recorded the missing sound effects at home.

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:36.510
I studied the latest shows and 
finished up the action scenes.

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:40.010
Good nap.

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:45.140
G-Guys...

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:47.060
Why?

00:09:47.590 --> 00:09:49.900
I thought you didn't read my LINE message.

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:51.400
Your LINE message?

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:52.970
Oh.

00:09:52.970 --> 00:09:56.200
I was focused on work the whole night.

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:58.280
I never saw it.

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:00.660
My phone was turned off.

00:10:00.930 --> 00:10:03.550
Thank goodness, I totally thought...

00:10:03.550 --> 00:10:04.660
You thought what?

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:06.160
...that you'd all given—

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:09.920
But our director hadn't 
given up at all, Minoacchi.

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:13.950
You're right.

00:10:16.280 --> 00:10:18.180
All right!

00:10:18.450 --> 00:10:22.230
That aside, it's going to be tough 
getting people to fill the seats.

00:10:22.230 --> 00:10:24.570
Give up now, and it's over.

00:10:24.570 --> 00:10:26.980
A famous quote from <i>Slash Dunk</i>.

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:29.690
We need to learn from school club anime, huh?

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:31.690
School club anime...

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:34.330
What is it?

00:10:36.730 --> 00:10:39.880
Guys, I think we can use these.

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:43.090
Club Anime Talk!

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:44.960
Participants wanted!

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:49.200
What's Club Anime Talk?

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:52.440
You get to stand on a special 
stage to talk about your club,

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:54.960
as we watch club anime together.

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:57.070
For the baseball club, 
it would be <i>Ace of Bench</i>,

00:10:57.070 --> 00:10:58.970
and for tennis it would be 
<i>Fresh Prince of Tennis</i>.

00:10:59.270 --> 00:11:01.270
Wow, that takes me back.

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:03.970
I used to watch that when I was little.

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:08.850
We should be able to present our club's work 
and all enjoy the school festival together.

00:11:09.170 --> 00:11:11.350
We want to make it into a festival

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:15.140
where people with all kinds of tastes 
can discuss it to their hearts' content.

00:11:15.140 --> 00:11:16.440
That sounds fun.

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:17.750
I'm in!

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:18.860
Me, too.

00:11:18.540 --> 00:11:19.540
Me, too.

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:19.990
Me, too.

00:11:24.970 --> 00:11:26.120
It's futile.

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:32.290
My turn already?!

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:33.780
It's not the ending yet.

00:11:33.780 --> 00:11:36.500
Next episode, the legendary idol... Wait, no.

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:37.770
Killer artwork...

00:11:37.770 --> 00:11:39.000
Wait, no time?

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:40.010
Hang on!

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:45.010
<b>Arisu Can't Make Enough Money</b>

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:43.060
There! There it is!

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:45.010
Retake!

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:57.250
Man, don't point the camera 
at me without warning.

00:11:57.250 --> 00:11:59.530
I'm not good at ad lib.

00:12:02.570 --> 00:12:04.280
All right, I'm off!

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:06.350
Mii-chan, you have a milk mustache.

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:08.820
Good luck, Mii-chan.

00:12:10.350 --> 00:12:12.810
I'll go watch with my friend.

00:12:12.810 --> 00:12:13.540
Okay.

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:14.750
Thanks.

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:15.420
Minoa.

00:12:16.370 --> 00:12:18.670
I believe in you, so you believe in you.

00:12:21.250 --> 00:12:23.780
That's from <i>Guden Daran</i>, isn't it?

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:26.630
Thanks, Dad.

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:28.150
I'm heading out.

00:12:29.910 --> 00:12:31.610
See you.

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:35.560
Now, time to get ready to go.

00:12:36.070 --> 00:12:38.340
Dad, what's with the outfit?

00:12:38.340 --> 00:12:40.630
Look at Minoa working so hard.

00:12:40.630 --> 00:12:43.570
Her Dad's got to do what he can, too.

00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:45.820
You're great, dear.

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:47.570
Honey...

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:49.200
Okay, okay.

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:52.790
Oh, yeah, you invited your 
friends, didn't you?

00:12:53.260 --> 00:12:54.020
Yeah.

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:57.420
Mii-chan's going to be surprised.

00:12:57.790 --> 00:13:03.420
<b>Sakaneko Festival</b>

00:13:03.850 --> 00:13:05.430
This way.

00:13:05.810 --> 00:13:08.550
Form two lines. Don't shove.

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:12.050
Anime Club screening event.

00:13:12.510 --> 00:13:14.060
Please be there.

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:16.990
I hope you're all there.

00:13:17.510 --> 00:13:18.810
Only for you, Senpai!

00:13:19.320 --> 00:13:20.820
<b>Anime Club Original
Anime Screening</b>

00:13:19.990 --> 00:13:20.810
Here.

00:13:22.010 --> 00:13:23.130
This is the one.

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:24.950
I'll be there.

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:26.450
Thank you.

00:13:31.180 --> 00:13:34.410
That girl reminds me of someone.

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:43.130
This is the Club Anime Talk and anime 
screening hosted by the Anime Club.

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:44.990
Nihao, Minoa.

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:49.690
Beibei-chan.

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:51.090
Why?

00:13:51.090 --> 00:13:51.930
Mii-chan.

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:53.150
Onee-chan.

00:13:53.150 --> 00:13:54.580
She's my classmate.

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:57.320
I told her about you, 
and she said she knew you.

00:13:58.040 --> 00:14:00.690
You're studying at Onee-chan's school?

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:02.950
Making anime in a club?

00:14:02.950 --> 00:14:04.740
Japan's amazing.

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:08.570
I'd like to make anime 
when I get back to China.

00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:10.010
It's fun.

00:14:10.010 --> 00:14:11.380
Ask me anything.

00:14:11.380 --> 00:14:12.260
Okay.

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:23.090
<b>Anime Club Original
Anime Screening
Club Anime Talk</b>

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:37.140
President, the Anime Club!

00:14:37.840 --> 00:14:41.480
They currently have roughly 
80% of the seats filled.

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:50.740
Are we really going with that title?

00:14:51.230 --> 00:14:53.780
There isn't so much as a 
trace of the original script.

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:56.250
Can't I have at least that much?

00:14:56.680 --> 00:14:58.660
I got the audience warmed up.

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:00.120
Are you ready?

00:15:00.530 --> 00:15:04.930
I did my best to finish the missing 
scenes until the last minute, but.

00:15:04.930 --> 00:15:08.630
But we couldn't finish 
the ending song and art.

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:10.940
Thank you.

00:15:10.940 --> 00:15:13.190
We did the best we could.

00:15:13.190 --> 00:15:16.390
Thank you all very much.

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:23.850
I have an idea.

00:15:36.800 --> 00:15:38.610
B-But that's...

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:41.670
I'm sure you can pull it off, Minoa-chan.

00:15:41.940 --> 00:15:45.380
I think it's worth giving 
it a shot unrehearsed.

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:48.670
I feel uneasy about this, 
but I'll take one for the team.

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:52.820
I can't think of anything to be uneasy about.

00:15:52.820 --> 00:15:54.680
I have nothing but hope!

00:15:57.680 --> 00:15:58.660
All right.

00:15:59.220 --> 00:16:00.680
I'll give it a try.

00:16:01.410 --> 00:16:03.270
The wait is over.

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:09.190
We'll hereby begin the screening of 
the anime club's original anime short.

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:22.120
<b>"Space Girl Magical Robot Travels to Another World, 
Where She Sings and Dances, 
but in the End She Ascends to Heaven 
and the Two Are United"</b>

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:24.680
Here we go.

00:16:24.680 --> 00:16:27.710
RoboArisu, away!

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:33.220
Monies!

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:34.230
Stand!

00:16:34.230 --> 00:16:36.220
Stand, RoboArisu!

00:16:39.280 --> 00:16:40.620
Not enough money.

00:16:40.940 --> 00:16:42.730
Not enough money.

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:44.170
Shutting down.

00:16:47.210 --> 00:16:48.230
Transform!

00:16:50.750 --> 00:16:52.340
Hear me!

00:16:52.340 --> 00:16:55.220
Warrior of love, hope, and magic!

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:14.980
Magic Girl Erika!

00:17:14.980 --> 00:17:18.250
Let's end this, RoboArisu!

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:27.270
Come, Kaikai Blade!

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:31.960
Behold, Mad King Kai has 
descended from the nether world

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:34.830
to cast the most powerful defense spell!

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:39.280
Satanic Extra Strongest Shield!

00:17:42.510 --> 00:17:43.790
What are you, delusional?

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:54.500
Grandpa, don't die!

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:56.270
Grandfather!

00:17:56.270 --> 00:17:57.910
Dad will not die!

00:17:57.910 --> 00:17:59.690
He will be reborn!

00:17:59.250 --> 00:18:00.800
Bath's ready, dear.

00:17:59.690 --> 00:18:00.800
Maya!

00:18:02.190 --> 00:18:03.450
Hurry up and die.

00:18:04.740 --> 00:18:08.810
So long as RoboArisu is disabled, 
you don't stand a chance.

00:18:10.510 --> 00:18:11.440
Hang in there.

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:13.320
I have your back.

00:18:15.520 --> 00:18:17.410
My name is Yuirin!

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:20.720
I'm a magician that loves 
excitement and explosions!

00:18:25.940 --> 00:18:27.380
Now, everyone!

00:18:27.380 --> 00:18:29.780
We all need to cheer for RoboArisu.

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:33.210
Go, RoboArisu!

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:35.210
RoboArisu!

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:36.720
Get up, you lump of scrap!

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:47.980
Payment complete.

00:18:48.250 --> 00:18:50.980
RoboArisu, fire the Money Beam!

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:53.980
Money!

00:18:55.510 --> 00:19:00.240
I-Is this the power of money?!

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:07.750
Good luck.

00:19:09.470 --> 00:19:12.460
Ringon... Ringon...

00:19:12.990 --> 00:19:14.670
W-Wait, why me?

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:16.010
Let go!

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:19.000
Are you telling me to fly?

00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:20.960
Don't worry.

00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:22.910
We can fly.

00:19:25.730 --> 00:19:29.520
A-And the two are united in heaven.

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:33.520
Meow.

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:42.280
And peace on Earth is protected again.

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:44.540
Monies!

00:19:50.070 --> 00:19:51.790
That was pretty good, huh?

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:52.920
Yeah.

00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:55.920
That was great!

00:19:56.220 --> 00:19:58.120
Hey, what about the ending?

00:19:58.120 --> 00:19:59.670
I want to see more!

00:20:01.940 --> 00:20:05.430
All right, everyone, it's time for the ending.

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:07.970
Start the music.

00:21:33.780 --> 00:21:35.740
Good job, kids!

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:44.790
That choreography...

00:21:44.790 --> 00:21:47.610
That choreography is the legendary...

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:51.240
Minoa!

00:21:53.940 --> 00:21:54.940
Arisu-chan!

00:21:54.940 --> 00:21:56.220
Miko-chan!

00:21:56.220 --> 00:21:59.010
Stop, Minoa, I can't breathe.

00:21:59.010 --> 00:22:00.750
I guess this is all right once in a while.

00:22:01.060 --> 00:22:02.660
Minoacchi!

00:22:03.620 --> 00:22:06.570
I can't help but be moved to tears!

00:22:06.570 --> 00:22:10.010
That was an amazing concert, 
my little kittens.

00:22:20.080 --> 00:22:20.870
Yes.

00:22:21.570 --> 00:22:24.780
I'm sorry, Principal.

00:23:07.800 --> 00:23:10.110
That was great, President!

00:23:10.110 --> 00:23:10.910
Thanks.

00:23:10.910 --> 00:23:12.350
Let's keep going.

00:23:12.350 --> 00:23:13.710
What did we have next?

00:23:13.710 --> 00:23:14.680
Hello?

00:23:13.710 --> 00:23:17.780
It's your favorite, President.

00:23:14.680 --> 00:23:17.780
Stay longer? Of course.

00:23:17.780 --> 00:23:18.950
Oh, I'll have a cola.

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:21.120
One more for cola.

00:23:21.890 --> 00:23:23.830
Oh, I'll have French fries.

00:23:23.830 --> 00:23:27.160
French fries and honey toast, please.

00:23:27.160 --> 00:23:30.730
Pretty Fairy!

00:23:31.230 --> 00:23:36.010
Enemies of Mother Earth, 
cease your evil deeds!

00:23:36.010 --> 00:23:37.630
Cease them!
